## Use with BBB

**When to use this framework:**
- In the **Foundation** workflow — Select this framework during setup
- In the **Build-Characters** workflow — Use it to define arcs by phase
- In the **Character-Audit** workflow — Verify progression coherence
- In the **Chapter-Write** workflow — Know the current phase to align content

**Related files:**
- `workflows/foundation/data/psychological-5-phase.md` (this file)
- `workflows/build-characters/` — to define detailed arcs
- `workflows/character-audit/` — to verify coherence
- `workflows/living-bible/` — to track progression

